## System Integration Note for UI/UX (Feedback for Yugesh)
From a planning perspective, the frontend should not present these layers as commercial zoning. Instead, they must be displayed as **Conservation & Livelihood Toggles**. The user (planners, local authorities, or eco-focused entities) should be able to see the live intersection between environmental risk (oil/erosion) and community presence, allowing for rapid, data-backed protection workflows.
